[E-REFL] Error: `rfl` can't prove this
    ╭─[ soundness/literal-match-default-unlisted.sw:13:16 ]
    │
 13 │     | _ => Inr rfl
    │                ─┬─  
    │                 ╰─── `kind n` and `0` aren't equal
    │ 
    │ Note 1: `rfl` proves `a = b` only when both sides compute to the same value
    │ 
    │ Note 2: number patterns only test values: an arm with a variable or `_` where the others have numbers knows only that `n` is none of those numbers, not what it is. To use the shape of `n`, match on `Zero` and `Succ` instead
    │ 
    │ Note 3: this statement is false; a counterexample:
    │           n = 7
    │         `n = 3 ∨ kind n = 0` is false
────╯
